# The eight operations of the machine, applied to two given numbers.

π' → A
? → a
? → b
a + b → ?           # sum
a·b → ?             # product
a ∸ b → ?           # difference, or 0 if b is the greater
b ∸ a → ?
a:b → ?             # integer quotient
a mod b → ?         # remainder
a ÷ b → ?           # absolute difference
a ∪ b → ?           # the greater
a ∩ b → ?           # the smaller
Ω → π
